        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Patrick Stewart, Stan Lee, Jack Kirby\n- Roles: Captain Jean-Luc Picard, Professor Charles Xavier\n- Franchises: Star Trek: The Next Generation, X-Men\n- Products: X-Men film series, Marvel Comics comic books\n- Topics: theatre credits, film credits, television credits\n\nFacts:\n- Patrick Stewart is an English actor with theatre, film, and television credits.\n- Patrick Stewart is known for playing Captain Jean-Luc Picard in the Star Trek: The Next Generation franchise.\n- Patrick Stewart is known for playing Professor Charles Xavier in the X-Men film series.\n- The X-Men film series is an American superhero film series.\n- The X-Men film series is based on the fictional superhero team X-Men.\n- The X-Men superhero team originally appeared in comic books created by Stan Lee and Jack Kirby and published by Marvel Comics.",
